This repository includes modifications of files from NVIDIA's Ising-Decoding
project (https://github.com/NVIDIA/Ising-Decoding), Copyright (c) 2026 NVIDIA
CORPORATION & AFFILIATES, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0:

  - training/config_validator.patch is a diff against
    code/workflows/config_validator.py. It adds two environment-variable
    overrides: PREDECODER_FT_LR (learning rate) and PREDECODER_FT_BATCH (one
    batch size for all epochs).
  - training/configs/*.yaml are settings files derived from that project's
    conf/config_public.yaml, changed to select the SI1000 or depolarizing
    noise model, the noise strength, and the model size.

No model weights are included in this repository. The fine-tuned models
produced by this work are Derivative Models of NVIDIA's Ising pre-decoders.
They are distributed separately on Hugging Face
(https://huggingface.co/dreamstickkkkk9090/ising-predecoder-si1000-finetune)
under the NVIDIA Open Model License and are NOT covered by the Apache License.

The C++ benchmark links against PyMatching and Stim (both Apache-2.0) and
NVIDIA TensorRT; none of their source code is included here.
